  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint3/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. The candidate was sized and shipped in verdict-neutral form by INV-muhij remedy 3 (ef9c55f8bf, PR #774, INV-muhij satisfied): 14 such rows on the 16-repo cohort read at source, 1 true, no loop enclosing both. Live: subprocess.run(['ls']) then os.environ['TOKEN'] in one function gives SECRET-NO-SUBPROC confirmed_with_caveats with sink_before_source_only; the reversed order gives violated. The finding is reported but does not hold a verdict, which avoids the deletion risk this item warned about. MECHANISM: sink call precedes source in the same body: now marked walk_blocked_by=sink_before_source and made verdict-neutral. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 0174
